usage: study.py [-h]
                {pilot-register,pilot-run,pilot-review,pilot-semantic-review,pilot-continue,final-score}
                ...

Explicit paired development pilot and owner-scored final study commands. No
model calls occur on import or registration. Pilot configuration must name the
model, matched resource envelope, development units and baseline provenance.
Final protocol creation and acceptance criteria belong to the independent
owner.

positional arguments:
  {pilot-register,pilot-run,pilot-review,pilot-semantic-review,pilot-continue,final-score}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
